    "Name": "Mangonel MNL-3L",
    "Details": "The Mangonel MNL-3L was literally built around the massive torso bay which contained its primary weapons, a pair of Light Gauss Rifles, which when combined with its high speed allowed the 'Mech to dance around its targets at range. Unfortunately the single ton of reloads carried was adequate only for Clan Trials, while the pair of ER Medium Lasers mounted in each arm made it an effective close-ranged combatant only as long as its minimal armor held out.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
